  <div class="b b-button" style="--d:8/2/10/6;--m:83/2/85/8;z-index:28"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" href="/scheduling-new-client" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Schedule a new client</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button" style="--d:8/6/10/10;--m:94/2/96/8;z-index:29"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" href="/crisis-call">Crisis Call</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button" style="--d:8/10/10/14;--m:96/2/98/8;z-index:30"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeWhGOW9Ay2lBXyz9gyKosIVgrbkrKAPH2w11e03QG6FD3BJQ/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Referral Tracker</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button" style="--d:8/14/10/18;--m:92/2/94/8;z-index:17"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" href="#">Online Bookings</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:8/19/31/26;--m:23/2/35/10;z-index:2"><div class="shape" style="background:var(--shape);border-radius:40px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html inset-m" style="--d:9/20/12/25;--m:24/2/26/10;z-index:14"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-lightAccent">Resource Links</span></h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:12/2/16/18;--m:6/2/18/10;z-index:3"><div class="shape" style="background:var(--shape);border-radius:40px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:12/20/14/25;--m:28/3/30/9;z-index:6"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small" href="https://secure.simplepractice.com/calendar/appointments" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Simple Practice</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:13/3/16/11;--m:18/2/23/10;z-index:26"><div class="accordion"><details><summary></summary><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Check the Passdown update.</p></li><li><p>Check all texts, calls and emails for cancellations and put those in</p></li><li><p>Respond to all texts, missed calls and emails</p></li><li><p>Verify documents for any new clients that day. (text client and therapist of any that are incomplete)</p></li></ol></div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:13/3/15/11;--m:64/2/66/10;z-index:19"><div class="rte"><h3>Start of Day Checklist</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:13/11/15/17;--m:60/2/62/8;z-index:22"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1QIrJbIzoNtenFfOqAGBJzyx3nYSPVkLqOu7ECwLx-Kw/edit?resourcekey=&gid=1637988169#gid=1637988169" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Passdown Updates</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:14/20/16/25;--m:32/3/34/9;z-index:9"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small" href="https://my.openphone.com/inbox/PNak6LO8yh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Phone</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:16/20/18/25;--m:30/3/32/9;z-index:12"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small" href="https://publish.buffer.com/all-channels" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buffer</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:17/2/23/18;--m:66/2/78/10;z-index:8"><div class="shape" style="background:var(--shape);border-radius:40px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:18/3/22/11;--m:98/2/100/10;z-index:20"><div class="rte"><h3>End of Day Checklist</h3><h4>(Last hour of the day)</h4></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:18/11/20/17;--m:105/2/107/8;z-index:21"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeJ5UbM3riuT4YxH3OSCcceaIE4EGQcVVyQelUvdkBpemprsw/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Passdown Form</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:18/20/20/25;--m:26/3/28/9;z-index:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small" href="https://www.canva.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canva</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:19/3/22/11;--m:100/2/105/10;z-index:27"><div class="accordion"><details><summary></summary><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Ensure all texts, calls and emails have been answered</p></li><li><p>Check all documents for tomorrows new clients and send a reminder to fill out the docs.</p></li><li><p>Complete the pass down form</p></li></ol></div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:20/20/22/25;--m:35/3/37/9;z-index:7"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small" href="https://chatgpt.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat GPT</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:22/20/24/25;--m:37/3/39/9;z-index:10"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small" href="https://www.squarespace.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Squarespace</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:24/6/27/15;--m:85/2/87/10;z-index:16"><div class="rte"><h1 class="ta-center">Admin</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:24/20/26/25;--m:39/3/41/9;z-index:11"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hD9WZF0Nu6lo9-OTVJtoe7o8nsu8YGEBam3zhLD_nHw/edit?gid=0#gid=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Therapist Preference sheet</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:26/20/28/25;--m:41/3/43/9;z-index:13"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small" href="https://login.headway.co/u/login/identifier?state=hKFo2SBVWjcxc2ZBUm9JcTN2dVpIUjVMZlMxZWI4QkNZNktwQaFur3VuaXZlcnNhbC1sb2dpbqN0aWTZIGRzdmdaYUZJM3V4czg1bWxteWFZVW1UNzF2WnRCU01Lo2NpZNkgeEloZExOQndyNVRVYjJrakd5Mm1GamdLSkhFeEFYZFc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Headway</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:27/4/44/17;--m:87/2/92/10;z-index:25"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>Submitting Payroll</summary><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Go to the <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1JFs5ENfbAr4_QFXWTVoEXULX4Xxbhk5NdF9PIjfp-ow/edit?gid=1082563411#gid=1082563411" rel="noopener" target="_blank">payroll page</a> and using the payroll form responses update the spreadsheet.</p></li><li><p>Copy Columns A-D and paste into an email.</p></li><li><p>Send an email to <a href="mailto:nsbcpayroll@gmail.com"><u>nsbcpayroll@gmail.com</u></a> CC’ing “<a href="mailto:directors@tangiblementalhealth.com">directors@tangiblementalhealth.com</a>”</p></li></ol></div></details><details><summary>Onboarding New Employees</summary><div class="rte"><p><a href="/reception-onboarding" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Onboarding</a></p></div></details><details><summary>Waitlist updates</summary><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Go to Inquiries page on Simple Practice.</p></li><li><p>Sort by Therapist </p></li><li><p>Send an update to each therapist with the number of people that are on their waitlist and times the top 3 are looking for.</p></li><li><p>Send a message to each of the clients on the waitlist letting them know their position (This is <em>name </em>with Tangible Therapy. You are 2nd on the waitlist to meet with <em>insert Therapist</em>. We appreciate your patience and will reach out to you when an appointment becomes available.)</p></li></ol></div></details><details><summary>Notes Audit</summary><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Go to <a href="https://secure.simplepractice.com/reports/appointments" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Simple Practice Appointment Status</a> page</p></li><li><p>Click on <em>More</em> in the top bar and select <em>Include Documentation</em></p></li><li><p>Select the Clinician in the dropdown menu.</p></li><li><p>Identify the oldest missed note by looking at the <em>Progress Note Status</em> column and looking for No note. (Notice in the <em>Billing Code </em>column, if it is a no show, late cancel or consult then do not include it.)</p></li><li><p>Go to <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1JFs5ENfbAr4_QFXWTVoEXULX4Xxbhk5NdF9PIjfp-ow/edit?resourcekey=&amp;gid=367805700#gid=367805700" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Employee Performance</a> and enter the date in under the <em>Note Timeliness</em> category</p></li></ol></div></details><details><summary>Weekly Announcements</summary><div class="rte"><ol><li><p>Go to Orem Team Dashboard.</p></li></ol></div></details><details><summary>Social Media Posts</summary><div class="rte">Item description</div></details><details><summary>Management Report</summary><div class="rte">Item description</div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:29/19/53/26;--m:43/2/55/10;z-index:5"><div class="shape" style="background:var(--shape);border-radius:40px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html inset-m" style="--d:30/20/33/25;--m:44/2/46/10;z-index:15"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-accent">Login Credentials</span></h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:33/20/51/25;--m:55/2/60/10;z-index:18"><div class="rte"><p class="ta-center">Shared logins are kept in the team password manager, not on this page. Ask the practice manager for access.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:54/8/57/20;--m:62/2/64/10;z-index:23"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center">Role Expectations</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:57/7/70/21;--m:78/2/83/10;z-index:24"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>Priorities</summary><div class="rte"><ul><li><p>Phone Calls: Answer all calls when they come in. Missed calls should only happen when you’re on the other line. Return missed calls and voicemails immediately.</p></li><li><p>Texts and Emails: Respond to client texts and emails immediately if not on the phone or currently helping a client. If a full answer isn’t possible right away, acknowledge the message (e.g., <em>“Thanks for reaching out! I’ll check and get back to you shortly.”</em>).&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>Cancellations and Reschedules&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>New Client Requests</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Scheduling and client management: Documents, following-up, Scheduling and onboarding new clients</p></li><li><p>Downtime: Ensure all systems are up to date (modality form, calendar, etc.), Admin tasks</p></li></ul></div></details><details><summary>Scheduling</summary><div class="rte"><ul><li><p>Keep therapist calendars accurate and up to date.</p></li><li><p>Confirm new appointments promptly and handle reschedules/cancellations as needed.</p></li></ul><p></p></div></details><details><summary>Professionalism</summary><div class="rte"><ul><li><p>Always use a warm, professional, and empathetic tone.</p></li><li><p>Maintain <strong>confidentiality</strong> by following HIPAA and privacy guidelines.</p></li></ul></div></details><details><summary>Follow-Through</summary><div class="rte"><ul><li><p>Each morning, follow the start of day checklist.</p></li><li><p>Maintain organized, up-to-date records of therapist preferences, modalities, and availability so clients are matched quickly and correctly.</p></li><li><p>Communicate regularly with therapists about cancellations, waitlists, and new referrals.</p></li></ul></div></details><details><summary>Time Off</summary><div class="rte"><ul><li><p>Plan on being present for the entirety of all scheduled shifts.</p></li><li><p>Submit planned time off for approval at least <strong>2 weeks in advance</strong>.</p></li><li><p>For sick days or emergencies, notify the practice manager <strong>as soon as possible before the workday starts</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Coordinate coverage to ensure calls, texts, and emails are still handled.</p></li></ul></div></details></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

