  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:3/18/12/26;--m:23/2/34/10;z-index:3"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:10px"><img src="/images/20140301-trade-151-0124-copy-c79201.jpg" alt="Scenic landscape of a lake surrounded by mountains, with green hills in the foreground and cloudy sky overhead." width="2200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:14/8/20/20;--m:35/2/43/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Spread the Word </h2><p class="ta-center">It all begins with an idea. Maybe you want to launch a business. Maybe you want to turn a hobby into something more. Or maybe you have a creative project to share with the world. Whatever it is, the way you tell your story online can make all the difference.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-socialaccountlinks" style="--d:21/12/23/16;--m:43/2/45/10;z-index:4"><div class="social"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/tangible_therapy/" aria-label="Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="instagram" /></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100083729585174" aria-label="Facebook" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="facebook" /></a><a href="mailto:frontdesk@tangiblementalhealth.com" aria-label="Email" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="email" /></a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
